  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"3D熔爐\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E5nIMjX.png\"></p>\n\n<h1>Undopia 3D 熔爐</h1>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fundopia-3d-furnaces\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/undopia-3d-furnaces?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;color=1bd96a\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/undopia-3d-furnaces\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1171954?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=CurseForge&amp;color=f16436\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fundugt\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"ko-fi\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wv1uE4k.png\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>3D 熔爐為所有熔爐增添了微微的 3D 立體感與自訂底部紋理。\n同時也修復了 1.14 至 1.18 版本的煙燻爐紋理問題。</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Undopia Patch 資源包\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/beZ50qS.png\"></a></p>\n\n<p>此資源包為 Undopia Patch 系列的一部分。</p>\n\n<p>它由以下 Undopia Patch 功能組成</p>\n\n<p>\n    <img alt=\"ifzE66Q.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ifzE66Q.png\">\n<img alt=\"7B8xL4e.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7B8xL4e.png\">\n<img alt=\"oN8KBdB.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oN8KBdB.png\">\n<img alt=\"RFDISv8.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RFDISv8.png\">\n\n</p>\n\n<p>如果您想自訂其中任何功能，請使用 Undopia Patch 自訂工具。</p>\n\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<hr>\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fundopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\n<img alt=\"Wb9cSra.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Wb9cSra.png\">\n\n<p>從 <strong>KCB Hosting</strong> 取得您專屬的自訂遊戲伺服器！</p>\n\n</a>\n\n<hr>\n\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252fcustom-downloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"自訂工具\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UEAZSvr.png\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"常見問題\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GGUjVLj.png\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252fterms-and-conditions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"條款與條件\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kVzzs3F.png\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/UnduGT/undopiapatch/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"錯誤回報 / 功能建議\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mYSKqtv.png\"></a>\n</p>\n\n</div>",
